# Manual Depot Cache config, mimicking the customer setup (T-9105).
# Intentionally hand-written while the org's "auto-connect to Depot Cache"
# setting is ON, to reproduce the bazelrc collision on Depot runners.
#
# The customer injects the auth header via a bazelisk wrapper on the command
# line; here we put a placeholder header directly in the workspace rc so it
# shows up in `bazel info --announce_rc` next to Depot's injected one.
build --remote_cache=grpcs://cache.depot.dev
build --remote_header=authorization=OURS_MANUAL_TOKEN
startup --experimental_remote_repo_contents_cache
